--- META ---
name: Any with unknown @type
summary: Verify an unresolvable @type in google.protobuf.Any fails the call instead of silently dropping the payload
tags: [wkt, any]

--- ENDPOINT ---
wkt.AnyResponseService/GetWrapped

--- REQUEST ---
{
  "name": "unknown"
}

--- ERROR partial ---
{
  "code": 2
}

--- ASSERTS ---
.message | contains("unable to resolve")
.message | contains("type.googleapis.com/wkt.MissingResult")
